  "gaps_note": "No private captures repo was available for this run (no screenshots or page text to check against), so this spec is written from Step Functions product knowledge (provenance=reference throughout) rather than extracted from a capture. Scoped to what core/stepfunctions_core.py models for real: state machines (CRUD, versions, aliases), executions (start/stop/redrive/history), and activities — the state machines list/create, executions list/detail with event history + graph, and activities list/create/detail the queue goal asked for. Deliberately out of scope and omitted rather than stubbed: CloudWatch metrics/alarms dashboards, Map Runs drill-down, Workflow Studio's visual drag-and-drop editor (the Definition field is the JSON/ASL editor only), and X-Ray's actual trace viewer. Re-verify against a real capture when one becomes available."
